OL,3,GNEWSACall for answers after student
OL,4,Adies at boat party
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a student who died after
OL,7,Ffalling from a boat party in Portugal
OL,8,Fhas vowed to get answers about his
OL,9,Fdeath.
OL,11,FMaritime police found the body of
OL,12,FJulian Amaral, from High Wycombe,
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire, in the water five days
OL,14,Fafter he fell overboard on 1 September.
OL,16,FThe 23-year-old, who travelled to
OL,17,FLisbon for two family weddings, had
OL,18,Fbeen among 200 people at a white-themed
OL,19,Fparty on the boat.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
